# House Lannister, George R. R. Martin, A Song of Ice and Fire: A Game of Thrones (1996)
# to A Dance with Dragons (2011), their appendices, and The World of Ice & Fire (2014),
# "Appendix: Lannister Lineage" and "House Lannister under the Dragons".
# Gerold the Golden to Joffrey, Myrcella and Tommen, with the Freys of Genna's marriage
# and Robert Baratheon. Tywin and his wife Joanna are first cousins (her father Jason is
# Tytos's brother). Cersei and Jaime are twins, and Jaime is the father of her three
# children (A Game of Thrones ch. 45), so they are F = 9/32 in kinship2; Robert is their
# father in law only, a social parent in the app, so this file gives Jaime.
# Twins: Tywald and Tion, Cersei and Jaime, Willem and Martyn (twin sets in the app;
# PED has no column for them). Robert and Cersei's childless marriage is in the app only.
# Left out: Jason's son by his first wife and his bastard daughter, Marla Prester's four
# unnamed children, Cleos Frey's sons, Stafford's wife and children (with them between
# Cersei and Gendry's family, Robert is drawn twice), and the childless marriages of
# Tyrion (Tysha, Sansa Stark), Lancel, Joffrey and Tommen.
# PHENO 2 = dwarfism (Tyrion).
LANN	Gerold	0	0	1	1
LANN	Rohanne_Webber	0	0	2	1
# Gerold's four sons
LANN	Tywald	Gerold	Rohanne_Webber	1	1
LANN	Tion	Gerold	Rohanne_Webber	1	1
LANN	Tytos	Gerold	Rohanne_Webber	1	1
LANN	Jeyne_Marbrand	0	0	2	1
LANN	Jason	Gerold	Rohanne_Webber	1	1
LANN	Marla_Prester	0	0	2	1
# Tytos's children, in birth order, and their partners
LANN	Tywin	Tytos	Jeyne_Marbrand	1	1
LANN	Kevan	Tytos	Jeyne_Marbrand	1	1
LANN	Dorna_Swyft	0	0	2	1
LANN	Genna	Tytos	Jeyne_Marbrand	2	1
LANN	Emmon_Frey	0	0	1	1
LANN	Tygett	Tytos	Jeyne_Marbrand	1	1
LANN	Darlessa_Marbrand	0	0	2	1
LANN	Gerion	Tytos	Jeyne_Marbrand	1	1
LANN	Briony	0	0	2	1
# Jason's children by Marla
LANN	Joanna	Jason	Marla_Prester	2	1
LANN	Stafford	Jason	Marla_Prester	1	1
# The twins and Tyrion
LANN	Cersei	Tywin	Joanna	2	1
LANN	Jaime	Tywin	Joanna	1	1
LANN	Tyrion	Tywin	Joanna	1	2
LANN	Robert	0	0	1	1
LANN	Gendry_mother	0	0	2	1
